videos.xyz.net
=> . root level name
=> .net => top level domain 
=> .xyz => secondery level domain ( domain apex )
=> vidoes => subdomian 

/etc/hosts => you can add IPs with domains in it 
/etc/nsswitch.conf => you can switch dns and hosts file presdedence
/etc/reslov.conf => nameserver => dns server entry
                    search => domain to suffix your search 


ansible vars
vars syntax "{{ var_name }}"
vars could be in the playbook or inventory file or as a command line 
in playbook as "vars" key 
--extra-vars if given in the command line